  r_h,l sensitivity (+10%):  d ln sigma / Newton vs law (canonical)
   NGC 2419  Newton  -4.7%   law  -1.8%
   Pal 3     Newton  -4.7%   law  -1.8%
   Pal 4     Newton  -4.7%   law  -1.2%
